  "verified": false,
  "notes": "One set issued in two waves; the factory set is a packaging of the whole 700-card base, not a separate set. Two variation programs are kept apart because Topps prints genuinely different names for them across series and merging would be a guess: Vintage Stock (Series 1) vs Vintage Stock Retro (Series 2), and Rookie 1952 (Series 1, 25 cards) vs 1952 (Series 2, 20 cards). Short Print Rookies reuse base numbers #697-700 — see schema/1.0/ROW-FORMAT.md, Numbering scope."
